# Research & Open Source

Alongside product work, I’ve been exploring systems where the quality of the result depends on the quality of the process.

## Fly Ecosystem

An observable artificial-life ecosystem focused on inherited neural controllers, evolution, and reproducible experiments. The project is a way to study adaptive behavior as a system that can be inspected, replayed, and measured.

## Agent tooling

I also work in open-source agent tooling and MCP-compatible developer workflows, including the Hermes Agent ecosystem and the OpenCode-based Finny codebase.

This thread connects the rest of my work: build the system, make the evidence visible, and leave behind tools that other people can inspect and extend.
